ed from a failure, mixed reachable-voter/non-voter layouts are not exercised so the tipping threshold is unmeasured, and the leader is judged before lease expiry. Accepting this review should lift the unreviewed-correspondence blocker on this second witness and record it as a validated additional witness for the same finding. About five minutes remain.\"}"}}
